  <Title type="string">Beyond the long argument with the colour blue</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">Dmitri Dubois-Ngata talks about how to hang a painting upside down on purpose. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</synopsis>
